    {
      "id": 18,
      "type": "text",
      "title": "Retirement gates remain separate",
      "description": "",
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 53,
        "w": 24,
        "h": 4
      },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "A blocked request and an empty poll both prove a caller exists. Do not enable retirement policy solely to turn a panel green. Before removing handlers, finish the remaining B16 instrumentation, prove continuous zero use over the agreed window, verify alert delivery, and resolve stopped-job/storage recovery. Keep repair actions in the approved `report_only` mode."
      }
